WEBVTT


00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.122
This is Angela Chen reporting live
from the site of a massive battle


00:00:18.124 --> 00:00:21.426
between the Justice League and a
group of what can only be described


00:00:21.428 --> 00:00:25.129
as super-villains calling
themselves the Legion of Doom.


00:00:25.131 --> 00:00:28.399
Reports state that earlier, the
Legion launched a surprise attack


00:00:28.401 --> 00:00:31.302
on the League at the unveiling
of their new headquarters,


00:00:31.304 --> 00:00:35.173
dubbed by many on social media
as "The Hall of Justice."


00:01:03.904 --> 00:01:06.871
Is this any way to treat
your guests, Superman?


00:01:06.873 --> 00:01:10.074
Seeing as how you crashed the
party, I'd consider us even.


00:01:10.744 --> 00:01:12.043
Oh!


00:01:40.373 --> 00:01:41.940
What happened, Toymaster?


00:01:41.942 --> 00:01:43.575
Did Mama kick you
out of the basement?


00:01:43.577 --> 00:01:44.676
Hmph.


00:01:56.957 --> 00:01:58.723
Grundy smash!


00:02:19.779 --> 00:02:23.548
Grundy sleep now.


00:02:26.052 --> 00:02:28.419
Robin, report.
How's crowd control?


00:02:29.889 --> 00:02:31.656
Huh?


00:02:36.963 --> 00:02:41.199
Well at hand, Father. As predicted,
they respond like contemptible sheep.


00:02:43.269 --> 00:02:45.169
Surrender, Cheetah.


00:02:45.171 --> 00:02:47.472
This doesn't have
to end in violence.


00:03:00.887 --> 00:03:02.220
Aah!


00:03:14.334 --> 00:03:16.334
You're smarter
than this, Luthor.


00:03:19.305 --> 00:03:21.906
Your kind attracts their kind.


00:03:21.908 --> 00:03:25.643
I'm simply an innocent industrialist
caught in the middle.


00:03:25.645 --> 00:03:27.045
I'll bet.


00:03:36.322 --> 00:03:37.989
You'll pay for this.


00:03:37.991 --> 00:03:39.724
Knowing you, it's insured.


00:03:53.907 --> 00:03:55.273
Huh?


00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.576
Beep, beep.


00:03:58.912 --> 00:04:00.111
Huh?


00:04:08.621 --> 00:04:09.821
Not in the face.


00:04:10.824 --> 00:04:12.156
Whatever you say.


00:04:21.034 --> 00:04:22.734
Playtime's over, Toymaster.


00:04:22.736 --> 00:04:25.403
But I enjoy
a good game.


00:04:26.306 --> 00:04:28.539
And I always win.


00:04:51.731 --> 00:04:53.231
Good work, team.


00:04:53.233 --> 00:04:55.500
Too bad Shazam and Lantern
had to miss the fun.


00:04:55.502 --> 00:04:57.468
Yeah. Slackers.


00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.209
We got a runner.


00:05:08.782 --> 00:05:09.881
Aah!


00:05:15.789 --> 00:05:18.156
Come on, Wizard,
don't make me hit you again.


00:05:20.527 --> 00:05:22.360
Uh, Wiz?


00:05:22.362 --> 00:05:24.862
Azarath calls,


00:05:24.864 --> 00:05:28.232
the child must answer.


00:05:28.234 --> 00:05:31.702
The hour of his rising
is at hand.


00:05:31.704 --> 00:05:32.837
Oh, boy.


00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.206
I've got this.


00:05:48.254 --> 00:05:50.888
Hmm. What the hell
did he hit me with?


00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:53.591
Himself, apparently.


00:05:58.965 --> 00:06:00.832
He's not using any tech.


00:06:00.834 --> 00:06:02.300
It's magic.


00:06:08.975 --> 00:06:11.175
Argh!


00:06:16.649 --> 00:06:18.149
Get them to safety.


00:06:18.151 --> 00:06:19.684
I'll keep him distracted.


00:06:30.263 --> 00:06:31.796
Argh!


00:06:33.733 --> 00:06:35.266
Argh!


00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.875
Robin, get all civilians
inside, do you read me?


00:06:43.877 --> 00:06:46.577
I have a more efficient way
to keep them safe, Father.


00:06:46.579 --> 00:06:50.047
<i>Robin?
Robin, I gave you a task.</i>


00:06:50.049 --> 00:06:54.352
Yes, as a human cattle prod.
I'm being under-utilized.


00:06:56.489 --> 00:06:58.022
<i>What's your location?</i>


00:06:58.024 --> 00:06:59.891
Where I need to be.


00:06:59.893 --> 00:07:01.559
In the driver's seat.


00:07:01.561 --> 00:07:04.061
Between the missile
and fuel cell detonations,


00:07:04.063 --> 00:07:06.564
I'd estimate at least
a three kiloton hit.


00:07:08.935 --> 00:07:10.902
Target locked.


00:07:10.904 --> 00:07:12.436
Damian, stand down.


00:07:13.873 --> 00:07:14.972
Too late now.


00:07:41.634 --> 00:07:42.900
Stand down!


00:07:45.838 --> 00:07:48.739
The lasso compels you
to obey my command!


00:07:58.318 --> 00:07:59.417
What happened?


00:07:59.419 --> 00:08:00.751
He doesn't know.


00:08:02.789 --> 00:08:04.909
I thought that would knock
the fight out of him.


00:08:08.094 --> 00:08:10.461
What? We got him, didn't we?


00:08:10.463 --> 00:08:13.064
What we have is an empty shell
with no answers.


00:08:13.066 --> 00:08:16.467
If you had followed orders and done
what you're told, we'd know more.


00:08:16.469 --> 00:08:18.069
Come on,
cut him some slack.


00:08:18.071 --> 00:08:19.503
At least, he was trying to...


00:08:22.108 --> 00:08:23.975
Not that I disagree.


00:08:23.977 --> 00:08:27.378
You buried me in a worthless
position to keep me out of the way.


00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.580
And I solved the entire problem.


00:08:29.582 --> 00:08:31.082
This isn't about you.


00:08:31.084 --> 00:08:32.550
It's about teamwork.


00:08:32.552 --> 00:08:35.853
All I see is a lot
of ineffectual grandstanding.


00:08:35.855 --> 00:08:38.122
Which is why I prefer
to work alone.


00:08:38.124 --> 00:08:41.058
And my dad
thinks I'm difficult.


00:08:42.195 --> 00:08:44.562
Have you ever considered
boarding school?


00:09:11.124 --> 00:09:12.490
I could've driven myself.


00:09:12.492 --> 00:09:14.291
After the stunt you pulled?


00:09:14.293 --> 00:09:17.094
You're lucky to be allowed within
10 feet of a steering wheel.


00:09:20.967 --> 00:09:22.666
So, this is my punishment?


00:09:22.668 --> 00:09:24.902
Enduring a bunch
of school children?


00:09:24.904 --> 00:09:26.804
This is not punishment.


00:09:26.806 --> 00:09:29.073
Hopefully, you'll learn
to be a part of a team.


00:09:29.075 --> 00:09:32.276
And they're not children.
They're teenagers.


00:09:32.278 --> 00:09:33.878
Worse.


00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:36.720
Don't tell me Damian Wayne is
afraid of a little socializing.


00:09:37.316 --> 00:09:39.350
I'm not afraid of anything.


00:09:39.352 --> 00:09:40.818
Teammates are a liability.


00:09:41.154 --> 00:09:42.286
Really?


00:09:42.288 --> 00:09:43.821
Then what am I to you?


00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.024
An unavoidable irritation.


00:10:31.003 --> 00:10:32.970
You were having
a nightmare last night.


00:10:32.972 --> 00:10:34.972
I was just wondering
if everything's...


00:10:34.974 --> 00:10:38.375
Look, I appreciate your concern, I guess.
But they're dreams.


00:10:38.377 --> 00:10:39.877
Just dreams.


00:10:46.586 --> 00:10:48.185
You know you're naked, right?


00:10:48.187 --> 00:10:49.520
Huh?


00:10:49.922 --> 00:10:51.622
Aah!


00:10:51.624 --> 00:10:53.791
I overslept. Was rushing.


00:10:53.793 --> 00:10:58.028
Forgot to put on my uniform. Okay?
So I sleep in the nude. So what?


00:10:58.598 --> 00:11:00.631
Animals are naked.


00:11:00.633 --> 00:11:04.768
I'm the entire animal kingdom crammed
into a single magnificent specimen.


00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.670
You're something crammed
into something.


00:11:08.908 --> 00:11:10.774
What did that thing just say?


00:11:10.776 --> 00:11:12.543
It was just laughing at you.


00:11:12.545 --> 00:11:14.278
Yeah, well, butt out, bug.


00:11:15.548 --> 00:11:18.115
Yow! Keep that thing
on a leash, man!


00:11:18.117 --> 00:11:19.917
I told you, don't annoy it.


00:11:22.455 --> 00:11:23.687
Jaime's right.


00:11:23.689 --> 00:11:25.856
That scarab is not a pet.


00:11:25.858 --> 00:11:27.858
It may be fused
to Jaime's spine,


00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:31.295
but it's not exactly
under his control.


00:11:31.297 --> 00:11:32.663
It's like you and your pants.


00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:35.799
That's why Jaime's here.


00:11:35.801 --> 00:11:37.701
That's why we're all here.


00:11:37.703 --> 00:11:40.104
To help each other
control our gifts.


00:11:40.106 --> 00:11:42.439
Help one another
become our best selves.


00:11:42.441 --> 00:11:46.243
Where else are we gonna go? I mean,
we're a bunch of freaks, right?


00:11:46.245 --> 00:11:50.114
Come on, Jaime, we're all family.
Like the Three Amigos.


00:11:50.116 --> 00:11:51.315
Four.


00:11:51.317 --> 00:11:52.583
Five.


00:11:54.687 --> 00:11:56.053
We're getting a visitor.


00:12:01.594 --> 00:12:03.093
Try not to behead anyone.


00:12:08.768 --> 00:12:10.701
- Nightwing.
- Starfire.


00:12:12.338 --> 00:12:13.704
It's been awhile.


00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:15.606
I know.


00:12:15.608 --> 00:12:16.941
You're looking good.


00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:19.343
This is Damian.


00:12:19.345 --> 00:12:21.045
The new Robin.


00:12:21.047 --> 00:12:22.246
Welcome, Damian.


00:12:26.786 --> 00:12:28.219
I'll be in my room.


00:12:28.221 --> 00:12:30.554
- Would you like to...
- I think I can manage.


00:12:31.557 --> 00:12:34.225
That is one creepy <i>mocoso.</i>


00:12:34.227 --> 00:12:37.161
No, more like sad.


00:12:42.068 --> 00:12:46.437
Yeah, I was thinking a movie might be nice.
Just you and me.


00:12:46.439 --> 00:12:48.105
No men in tights.


00:12:48.107 --> 00:12:49.273
That sounds nice.


00:12:49.275 --> 00:12:51.742
By the way, I bought
some new glasses.


00:12:51.744 --> 00:12:54.144
You might not recognize me.


00:12:54.146 --> 00:12:55.879
I'm sure I'll be able
to pick you out


00:12:55.881 --> 00:12:57.514
no matter what you're wearing.


00:12:57.516 --> 00:12:59.049
See you soon.


00:13:12.431 --> 00:13:13.797
Hello?


00:13:30.616 --> 00:13:33.951
If this is a prank, you're
screwing with the wrong guy.


00:14:04.083 --> 00:14:05.149
Hah!


00:14:08.487 --> 00:14:11.322
He hasn't stopped
for an hour and a half.


00:14:12.792 --> 00:14:15.959
Damian, it's time
to let others have their turn.


00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:19.997
I'm not finished.


00:14:19.999 --> 00:14:21.098
Hah!


00:14:25.237 --> 00:14:27.338
Gee, how'd that happen?


00:14:31.744 --> 00:14:32.843
What the hell?


00:14:32.845 --> 00:14:35.579
Hmph, I heard your tech
was fast.


00:14:35.581 --> 00:14:37.614
I wanted to see how fast.


00:14:37.616 --> 00:14:39.717
Don't mess with us, little man.


00:14:40.219 --> 00:14:41.785
All right.


00:14:41.787 --> 00:14:45.055
I can see we are getting off
on the wrong foot.


00:14:45.825 --> 00:14:48.258
Damian, this is a team effort.


00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:50.761
We need to be willing
to accommodate others.


00:14:50.763 --> 00:14:53.030
Nightwing said
you were a princess.


00:14:54.166 --> 00:14:55.499
Exiled, no doubt.


00:14:55.501 --> 00:14:58.102
Technically, it was a coup.


00:14:58.104 --> 00:15:01.305
And like it or not, I am
the leader of this group.


00:15:01.307 --> 00:15:04.641
As I see it, you're an alien
with nowhere else to go.


00:15:04.643 --> 00:15:06.577
Everyone needs a home, Damian.


00:15:06.579 --> 00:15:07.878
You included.


00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.314
Thank you for chiming in,
witch girl.


00:15:10.316 --> 00:15:13.751
We are only here to help you
realize your potential.


00:15:13.753 --> 00:15:15.252
You've been here long enough.


00:15:15.254 --> 00:15:17.454
When do you think
you'll realize yours?


00:15:19.692 --> 00:15:22.693
Dude, you need
to show some respect.


00:15:22.695 --> 00:15:24.962
Argh!


00:15:27.233 --> 00:15:28.432
Oh, no.


00:15:33.305 --> 00:15:34.838
Ready when you are.


00:15:37.209 --> 00:15:39.009
No, stop this.


00:15:41.347 --> 00:15:42.713
Hah!


00:15:46.385 --> 00:15:49.353
Who's fighting me,
you or the bug?


00:15:49.355 --> 00:15:50.754
You'd better hope it's me.


00:16:07.406 --> 00:16:09.473
That's the difference
between you and me.


00:16:09.475 --> 00:16:11.108
You wear a weapon.


00:16:11.677 --> 00:16:13.243
I am a weapon.


00:16:15.114 --> 00:16:16.914
No!


00:16:17.683 --> 00:16:19.149
Aah!


00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.489
Enough!


00:16:27.359 --> 00:16:29.126
I tried to stop it.


00:16:32.832 --> 00:16:34.932
<i>Dios mio.</i> Is he dead?


00:16:36.902 --> 00:16:39.470
He's still alive. Barely.


00:16:39.472 --> 00:16:42.673
This is going to be
an awkward call to Batman.


00:16:42.675 --> 00:16:44.007
Everyone get back.


00:16:46.111 --> 00:16:50.013
By the powers of Azarath,
I beseech you.


00:16:50.015 --> 00:16:53.083
Azarath, Metrion, Zinthos.


00:17:04.463 --> 00:17:06.630
We need to get her
back to her room.


00:17:06.632 --> 00:17:07.998
Garfield?


00:17:09.101 --> 00:17:10.367
I've got her.


00:17:14.607 --> 00:17:16.306
What... What happened?


00:17:16.308 --> 00:17:19.042
Raven healed you.
We have to tend to her.


00:17:20.412 --> 00:17:21.845
Sorry.


00:17:28.554 --> 00:17:30.888
I knew you'd be here
working all night.


00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:32.422
Thought you might be hungry.


00:17:33.926 --> 00:17:35.359
No, thanks.


00:17:35.361 --> 00:17:36.593
Suit yourself.


00:17:39.698 --> 00:17:42.432
Where does all that food go
if you don't have a stomach?


00:17:43.435 --> 00:17:44.902
You don't wanna know.


00:17:44.904 --> 00:17:46.770
What are you up to?


00:17:46.772 --> 00:17:48.772
I've been combing through footage
from every camera on the grid.


00:17:48.774 --> 00:17:49.840
And?


00:17:49.842 --> 00:17:51.542
There's something odd.


00:17:51.544 --> 00:17:54.311
Dark spots.
They're hard to make out.


00:17:57.216 --> 00:17:59.182
Activate quadrant
pixel enhancement.


00:18:05.424 --> 00:18:06.557
Show-off.


00:18:10.129 --> 00:18:11.295
What is that? A shadow?


00:18:11.297 --> 00:18:13.697
No, the sun direction is wrong.


00:18:13.699 --> 00:18:16.500
And look here, it's
disconnected from the surface.


00:18:17.403 --> 00:18:19.436
It's mimicking a shadow.


00:18:19.438 --> 00:18:20.837
It has intelligence.


00:18:20.839 --> 00:18:23.519
It's wandering, like it's
looking for something.


00:18:23.876 --> 00:18:25.943
Or someone.


00:18:25.945 --> 00:18:28.445
There's where Weather Wizard
ran into it.


00:18:28.447 --> 00:18:30.013
More like stepped in it.


00:18:30.015 --> 00:18:31.855
You don't think
it was after him.


00:18:32.017 --> 00:18:33.317
No.


00:18:33.319 --> 00:18:34.451
I don't.


00:18:40.059 --> 00:18:43.660
Don't get me wrong, I love
catching up on popular culture


00:18:43.662 --> 00:18:46.930
but the harsh language
was entirely unnecessary,


00:18:46.932 --> 00:18:50.801
and the female lead seemed to only
be present in order to be rescued


00:18:50.803 --> 00:18:52.436
by the leading man.


00:18:52.438 --> 00:18:55.118
But all in all, I found
myself reasonably diverted.


00:18:57.309 --> 00:18:58.475
Clark?


00:19:00.379 --> 00:19:03.313
<i>Trigon lives.</i>


00:19:06.418 --> 00:19:08.986
Are you all right?


00:19:08.988 --> 00:19:10.587
Sorry, it's just...


00:19:11.857 --> 00:19:13.624
I've got a lot on my mind
right now.


00:19:13.626 --> 00:19:16.093
You can always share
your burdens with me, Clark.


00:19:19.565 --> 00:19:21.698
Ugh, stay away from me.


00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.150
Hey!


00:19:40.152 --> 00:19:41.985
What is wrong with you?


00:19:41.987 --> 00:19:44.254
That is
very dangerous.


00:19:44.256 --> 00:19:46.556
You could put out an eye
with that thing.


00:19:46.558 --> 00:19:49.559
Didn't your mother tell you
never to play with knives?


00:19:49.561 --> 00:19:51.561
By the powers
of Azarath,


00:19:51.563 --> 00:19:53.196
I beseech you.


00:19:53.198 --> 00:19:55.098
Mother spirit
of the nether realm,


00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.067
protect my brothers and sister.


00:19:57.069 --> 00:20:00.237
And give me strength to face the
dark force I fear is coming.


00:20:12.484 --> 00:20:15.085
I suppose I should thank you
for healing me.


00:20:17.289 --> 00:20:19.956
Um, you're welcome.


00:20:19.958 --> 00:20:22.192
It was strange
having you in my head.


00:20:22.194 --> 00:20:24.761
I felt you prying
into my entire life.


00:20:24.763 --> 00:20:26.730
It was not appreciated.


00:20:26.732 --> 00:20:30.000
I'm an empath, and if it
makes you feel any better,


00:20:30.002 --> 00:20:31.802
I didn't see it
as much as felt it.


00:20:31.804 --> 00:20:33.970
And I've been trying
to shake it off ever since.


00:20:33.972 --> 00:20:37.407
Then you know I'm not meant to
be here at this stupid school.


00:20:37.409 --> 00:20:39.643
I was groomed
for a higher calling.


00:20:39.645 --> 00:20:40.677
My grandfather's...


00:20:40.679 --> 00:20:42.245
I know all about
your grandfather.


00:20:42.247 --> 00:20:45.015
I felt him. He was a demon.


00:20:45.017 --> 00:20:48.085
And believe me,
I know my demons.


00:20:48.921 --> 00:20:50.420
He was a great man.


00:20:50.422 --> 00:20:53.557
We were going to make
the world stronger, better.


00:20:53.559 --> 00:20:56.159
We were going
to rule it together.


00:20:56.161 --> 00:20:58.228
I know all about that game, too.


00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:02.265
Now, I don't mean to be rude, but would
you mind getting the hell away from me?


00:21:05.904 --> 00:21:10.340
You know, when you were in my head,
I could see things about you, too.


00:21:10.342 --> 00:21:13.243
- Like what?
- It looked like a man.


00:21:13.245 --> 00:21:15.712
But something more.


00:21:15.714 --> 00:21:18.181
Who... What was that thing?


00:21:18.183 --> 00:21:21.084
It was nothing, a nightmare.


00:21:21.086 --> 00:21:24.387
It was real, I could tell.


00:21:24.389 --> 00:21:27.491
It's none of your business.
Who are you to judge my life?


00:21:27.493 --> 00:21:29.359
You have other things
to fix here.


00:21:29.361 --> 00:21:31.261
Just stay away from me, okay?


00:21:37.102 --> 00:21:39.069
Steady...


00:21:41.106 --> 00:21:43.507
Ah. Argh!


00:21:43.509 --> 00:21:47.010
Can you please do that
anywhere else?


00:21:47.012 --> 00:21:48.311
Jaime?


00:21:49.848 --> 00:21:52.349
Yeah?


00:21:52.351 --> 00:21:54.951
Perhaps it was a mistake to challenge
you this morning without knowing


00:21:54.953 --> 00:21:59.656
the full capacity
of your alien attachment.


00:21:59.658 --> 00:22:02.459
I promise you,
it won't happen again.


00:22:07.166 --> 00:22:09.199
Did he just say he's sorry?


00:22:09.868 --> 00:22:12.536
Aw, see. He likes you.


00:22:34.893 --> 00:22:37.727
<i>Trigon lives.</i>


00:22:58.317 --> 00:23:00.417
Atomic Skull.


00:23:00.419 --> 00:23:02.385
We had quite a tumble last year.


00:23:02.387 --> 00:23:06.923
Still, I sensed you, being a
good guy and all, playing nice.


00:23:08.193 --> 00:23:10.060
You won't have to this time.


00:23:10.062 --> 00:23:12.495
I've gotten
a lot, lot, stronger.


00:23:16.268 --> 00:23:17.767
You don't look so good.


00:23:32.651 --> 00:23:34.618
Okay, okay.


00:23:54.606 --> 00:23:57.841
He's barely alive, Clark,
what's wrong with you?


00:24:01.246 --> 00:24:02.846
He's not himself.


00:24:02.848 --> 00:24:04.247
What is that?


00:24:04.249 --> 00:24:05.548
Kryptonite.


00:24:06.618 --> 00:24:08.585
Guess he doesn't
tell you everything.


00:24:10.355 --> 00:24:13.957
The rising is coming.


00:24:13.959 --> 00:24:16.626
You cannot stop it.


00:24:18.797 --> 00:24:21.264
Superman, someone
is controlling you.


00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:25.602
You have your part to play.


00:24:25.604 --> 00:24:27.137
Both of you.


00:24:27.139 --> 00:24:30.907
The girl will be taken.


00:24:32.277 --> 00:24:33.576
Girl?


00:24:37.249 --> 00:24:38.648
Diana, wait!


00:24:38.650 --> 00:24:40.951
- We cannot let him...
- I've alerted Trevor.


00:24:40.953 --> 00:24:43.853
With any luck, military
satellites are tracking him now.


00:24:43.855 --> 00:24:45.422
And what will we do?


00:24:45.424 --> 00:24:47.324
Wait for him to...


00:24:47.326 --> 00:24:49.292
Pull the moon from the sky?


00:24:49.294 --> 00:24:51.828
No, we'll get...


00:24:51.830 --> 00:24:54.931
He hasn't said anything about doing
something like that, has he?


00:24:55.334 --> 00:24:57.267
No, but...


00:24:57.269 --> 00:25:00.670
We're both targets and for all we
know, so is the rest of the League.


00:25:02.407 --> 00:25:04.274
Get back to that island of yours


00:25:04.276 --> 00:25:06.910
and lock yourself in the darkest,
deepest tomb you can find.


00:25:06.912 --> 00:25:08.278
I'll call.


00:25:08.280 --> 00:25:10.580
But Clark and I are...


00:25:10.582 --> 00:25:13.450
You can't expect me to hide.


00:25:13.452 --> 00:25:15.318
Was worth a shot.


00:25:31.737 --> 00:25:34.104
What are you doing in my room?


00:25:34.106 --> 00:25:36.039
We have rules, Damian.


00:25:37.743 --> 00:25:40.176
You never trespass
another person's space.


00:25:40.178 --> 00:25:43.179
You have nothing on her.
No background, no history.


00:25:43.181 --> 00:25:44.347
On who?


00:25:44.349 --> 00:25:45.548
Raven.


00:25:45.550 --> 00:25:47.217
You're the leader of this group.


00:25:47.219 --> 00:25:48.618
You should know everything
about her.


00:25:48.620 --> 00:25:50.153
It's called "vetting."


00:25:50.155 --> 00:25:51.488
She's 14.


00:25:51.490 --> 00:25:53.323
No mother, no father.


00:25:53.325 --> 00:25:56.659
She grew up in a hostile realm,
not unlike my own planet.


00:25:56.661 --> 00:25:59.229
And she escaped, like I did.


00:25:59.231 --> 00:26:02.165
We didn't know anything about
Raven when we took her in


00:26:02.167 --> 00:26:04.200
except that she needed a home.


00:26:04.202 --> 00:26:06.436
A place to grow.


00:26:06.438 --> 00:26:11.007
I was taught that knowledge was power
and you knew nothing about her.


00:26:11.009 --> 00:26:14.077
How much do you have to know
when people are in need?


00:26:14.079 --> 00:26:18.314
Garfield was 11 when his genetics
kicked in and gave him green skin


00:26:18.316 --> 00:26:20.016
and powers.


00:26:20.018 --> 00:26:22.118
We still don't know the purpose
of Jaime's alien armor


00:26:22.120 --> 00:26:24.187
or all of its abilities.


00:26:24.189 --> 00:26:26.389
We just knew they needed help.


00:26:26.391 --> 00:26:28.958
You have to have
a little faith sometimes.


00:26:28.960 --> 00:26:32.062
Faith is belief
based on an absence of data.


00:26:32.064 --> 00:26:33.763
It invites disaster.


00:26:39.104 --> 00:26:42.238
You have no idea
how frustrating it is.


00:26:42.240 --> 00:26:44.741
He reminds me of my sister.


00:26:44.743 --> 00:26:47.510
<i>I told you he was tough.
Never had a childhood.</i>


00:26:47.512 --> 00:26:51.114
<i>Doesn't know how to act with kids
or anyone else for that matter.</i>


00:26:51.116 --> 00:26:53.049
It's affecting everybody.


00:26:53.051 --> 00:26:56.052
<i>Well, you can't expect him
to be great at bonding.</i>


00:26:56.054 --> 00:26:59.022
<i>Spent most of his life
training to kill.</i>


00:26:59.024 --> 00:27:01.224
<i>Then moves in
with the big bad bat,</i>


00:27:01.226 --> 00:27:04.266
<i>which I can tell you from personal
experience, is not exactly fun.</i>


00:27:05.363 --> 00:27:07.664
So you've told me.


00:27:13.338 --> 00:27:15.038
<i>Speaking of fun,</i>


00:27:15.040 --> 00:27:16.639
<i>the old room looks great.</i>


00:27:16.641 --> 00:27:18.308
<i>You know, Kori,
you and I could just...</i>


00:27:18.310 --> 00:27:20.743
- Fun.
<i>- What?</i>


00:27:20.745 --> 00:27:23.146
That's it, that's what we need.


00:27:23.148 --> 00:27:24.647
<i>What who needs?</i>


00:27:24.649 --> 00:27:26.716
Oh, you're so smart.
Thanks, Dick.


00:27:26.718 --> 00:27:28.852
<i>But Kori, I don't...</i>


00:27:30.322 --> 00:27:31.654
Fun.


00:27:37.963 --> 00:27:39.996
I wondered when you'd get back.


00:27:39.998 --> 00:27:41.264
They lost Superman.


00:27:41.266 --> 00:27:42.999
Fifty-five miles
off the coast.


00:27:43.001 --> 00:27:45.635
Flash is checking the area,
he just disappeared.


00:27:47.272 --> 00:27:48.872
Where the hell is he going?


00:27:48.874 --> 00:27:51.074
You have my feed
from the Batmobile?


00:27:55.447 --> 00:27:56.779
Yeah.


00:27:57.349 --> 00:27:58.882
That's messed up.


00:27:58.884 --> 00:28:01.551
The entity was strong enough
to possess a Kryptonian.


00:28:01.553 --> 00:28:04.154
It can't stay in the host
if the host is damaged.


00:28:04.156 --> 00:28:08.691
If I'd poisoned Superman with a
bigger dose, I might have saved him.


00:28:08.693 --> 00:28:12.695
Scour the net, narrow your search
results to Superman sightings


00:28:12.697 --> 00:28:14.731
and to recent
supernatural events.


00:28:15.467 --> 00:28:17.066
Supernatural?


00:28:17.536 --> 00:28:20.036
Yes. Subsection:


00:28:20.038 --> 00:28:21.104
Female.


00:29:08.520 --> 00:29:11.120
Aah! Dude, did you have
to bring the sword?


00:29:11.122 --> 00:29:13.690
Preparedness is a prerequisite
for victory.


00:29:13.692 --> 00:29:15.825
The gear stays
in the car, Damian.


00:29:15.827 --> 00:29:19.696
Tonight we are to enjoy
some mandatory fun.


00:29:31.243 --> 00:29:35.712
This is an opportunity for us to
become more familiar with each other.


00:29:35.714 --> 00:29:37.714
How much more
familiar can we get?


00:29:37.716 --> 00:29:40.183
We've already seen
Garfield lick himself.


00:29:40.185 --> 00:29:42.218
- As a dog?
- I wish.


00:30:13.285 --> 00:30:16.085
Just call me "Eagle Eyes."


00:30:45.617 --> 00:30:46.883
What?


00:30:49.487 --> 00:30:51.120
Huh?


00:31:46.144 --> 00:31:47.710
Here, have some.


00:31:50.615 --> 00:31:52.582
That tastes like pure sugar.


00:31:52.584 --> 00:31:55.251
Boy, were you up in those
mountains a long time.


00:31:57.722 --> 00:31:59.756
It was a joke,
I'm not criticizing.


00:31:59.758 --> 00:32:01.758
I knew it was a joke.


00:32:01.760 --> 00:32:04.694
And if you knew me, you wouldn't
waste your time trying.


00:32:05.964 --> 00:32:09.298
I guess neither of
our lives are very funny.


00:32:09.300 --> 00:32:12.101
But I'll tell you something about
yourself that not even you know.


00:32:12.804 --> 00:32:14.704
You may be insufferable,


00:32:14.706 --> 00:32:17.974
but in your heart, you are
a kind and generous soul.


00:32:51.209 --> 00:32:52.275
Booyah!


00:32:54.546 --> 00:32:57.480
Oh, looks like we found
something the bug can't do.


00:32:58.650 --> 00:33:00.917
Please, please, no autographs.


00:33:00.919 --> 00:33:02.952
I'm a busy man.


00:33:06.858 --> 00:33:09.725
Free popcorn to anyone
who can slay the beast.


00:33:09.727 --> 00:33:11.694
I can do it.


00:33:11.696 --> 00:33:13.396
You know how to dance?


00:33:13.398 --> 00:33:14.931
I'm a quick study.


00:33:20.505 --> 00:33:23.039
Hmm, all right.


00:33:28.413 --> 00:33:30.079
Hope you're a good loser.


00:33:40.825 --> 00:33:42.925
<i>Dance!</i>


00:34:42.820 --> 00:34:44.520
<i>Mira.</i> Look at them go.


00:34:47.759 --> 00:34:49.458
<i>Raven...</i>


00:34:52.564 --> 00:34:54.363
<i>They're waiting for you.</i>


00:35:05.610 --> 00:35:08.377
<i>On the hill,
beyond the tent.</i>


00:35:32.503 --> 00:35:34.303
Sister...


00:35:39.444 --> 00:35:41.577
He wants you.


00:35:42.680 --> 00:35:45.848
We've missed you, sister.


00:35:46.818 --> 00:35:48.951
It can't be him, it's a trick.


00:35:48.953 --> 00:35:50.953
<i>It is me, child.</i>


00:35:53.625 --> 00:35:54.991
How?


00:35:54.993 --> 00:35:58.260
<i>Never leave unfinished
what you start.</i>


00:35:58.262 --> 00:36:00.496
<i>- You fled.</i>
- I left.


00:36:00.498 --> 00:36:01.564
I had you.


00:36:02.700 --> 00:36:05.334
<i>Yet, here I am.</i>


00:36:06.904 --> 00:36:09.639
If you were really here,
I'd smell your stink.


00:36:09.641 --> 00:36:11.307
You're still trapped.


00:36:11.309 --> 00:36:13.442
All you can send
are these losers.


00:36:13.444 --> 00:36:16.028
<i>I will be there.</i>


00:36:16.029 --> 00:36:18.909
<i>It's our destiny to be
together, Raven, always.</i>


00:36:19.450 --> 00:36:21.017
<i>We're family.</i>


00:36:21.019 --> 00:36:23.185
<i>You can make that happen.</i>


00:36:23.187 --> 00:36:25.588
<i>You can bring me.</i>


00:36:25.590 --> 00:36:27.390
I will fight you every step.


00:36:27.392 --> 00:36:31.360
- You're an abomination. <i>-Watch
your talk, ungrateful girl.</i>


00:36:38.569 --> 00:36:40.236
<i>Look at yourself.</i>


00:36:40.238 --> 00:36:42.538
<i>Weak, lonely.</i>


00:36:42.540 --> 00:36:43.906
<i>Aligning with chattel.</i>


00:36:43.908 --> 00:36:48.244
<i>It is beneath my contempt
and I will not have it.</i>


00:36:48.246 --> 00:36:50.112
<i>You will be a part of
this, child.</i>


00:36:50.114 --> 00:36:53.983
<i>You will know
the glory of Trigon.</i>


00:36:53.985 --> 00:36:55.351
Argh!


00:36:56.888 --> 00:36:59.422
Mother of Azarath,
give me strength.


00:37:17.508 --> 00:37:20.176
You cannot last.
You're temporal agents.


00:37:20.178 --> 00:37:22.378
We will last long enough.


00:37:25.349 --> 00:37:26.415
Aah!


00:37:27.952 --> 00:37:29.218
He wants you.


00:37:29.220 --> 00:37:31.620
He will have you.


00:38:08.226 --> 00:38:10.192
Awesome, dude.


00:38:10.194 --> 00:38:12.394
Yes, quite impressive.


00:38:13.498 --> 00:38:15.898
You were
very good too, Garfield.


00:38:15.900 --> 00:38:18.167
Yeah, okay.


00:38:19.504 --> 00:38:20.469
Whatever.


00:38:25.676 --> 00:38:26.976
Ugh!


00:38:28.646 --> 00:38:31.247
Raven! Titans, go!


00:39:17.829 --> 00:39:20.696
They're demonic emissaries.
My father sent them.


00:39:20.698 --> 00:39:21.764
Your father?


00:39:26.437 --> 00:39:27.837
Damn it.


00:39:27.839 --> 00:39:29.104
Argh!


00:40:14.919 --> 00:40:17.686
Please tell me they're undead.


00:40:17.688 --> 00:40:20.289
Yes, but you can't stop them
like that.


00:40:20.291 --> 00:40:21.557
They're like batteries.


00:40:29.267 --> 00:40:31.166
Then let's run them down.


00:40:35.973 --> 00:40:37.239
Argh!


00:40:38.643 --> 00:40:39.808
Aah!


00:40:41.045 --> 00:40:43.312
Argh!


00:40:56.060 --> 00:40:57.459
Argh!


00:42:12.370 --> 00:42:16.071
Whoo, yeah, we kicked
demon boot-ay.


00:42:16.073 --> 00:42:17.339
Yeah, baby.


00:42:17.742 --> 00:42:18.807
Up top.


00:42:19.910 --> 00:42:20.976
Hit me.


00:42:22.913 --> 00:42:23.979
Hmm.


00:42:35.192 --> 00:42:37.993
Robin said I didn't know
enough about you.


00:42:37.995 --> 00:42:39.762
I think he was right.


00:42:39.764 --> 00:42:42.464
You told me
you didn't have a father.


00:42:42.466 --> 00:42:45.034
What I said is that he's gone.


00:42:45.036 --> 00:42:46.668
That's not the same as dead.


00:42:46.670 --> 00:42:47.936
He's dead to me.


00:42:49.840 --> 00:42:51.807
So, why is he
trying to kill you?


00:42:53.911 --> 00:42:55.511
He's not trying to kill me.


00:42:56.213 --> 00:42:57.780
It's much worse.


00:43:14.365 --> 00:43:17.499
Safe to say we're not in
Kansas anymore.


00:43:17.501 --> 00:43:20.302
It's no star field I recognize.


00:43:20.905 --> 00:43:22.471
Where are we?


00:43:23.474 --> 00:43:25.374
Somewhere my father
can't see us.


00:43:26.143 --> 00:43:28.343
All right, let's hear it.


00:43:29.280 --> 00:43:30.712
There's so much.


00:43:30.714 --> 00:43:32.614
I guess it starts with my mom.


00:43:37.855 --> 00:43:40.989
<i>She was young, rebellious
and gullible.</i>


00:43:40.991 --> 00:43:43.292
<i>Of course she wound up
in a cult.</i>


00:43:43.694 --> 00:43:45.227
<i>Anyway,</i>


00:43:45.229 --> 00:43:47.362
<i>they decided to do the
classic bride of Satan rite.</i>


00:43:47.364 --> 00:43:50.466
<i>And guess who got
to be the lucky bride?</i>


00:43:50.468 --> 00:43:52.768
<i>I doubt anyone
expected it to work,</i>


00:43:52.770 --> 00:43:55.570
<i>but the ancient ceremony turned
out to be the real thing.</i>


00:44:17.294 --> 00:44:18.594
<i>So, Mom,</i>


00:44:18.596 --> 00:44:20.596
<i>with her great powers
of judgment,</i>


00:44:20.598 --> 00:44:23.678
<i>didn't hesitate to hook up with the
guy who emerged from the smoke.</i>


00:44:34.879 --> 00:44:36.445
<i>Whoa, whoa,
whoa, wait.</i>


00:44:36.447 --> 00:44:38.780
So, your mom did it with Satan?


00:44:38.782 --> 00:44:42.084
His name is Trigon,
but basically, yes.


00:44:42.086 --> 00:44:44.286
But they totally did it.


00:44:44.288 --> 00:44:46.155
Garfield?


00:44:46.157 --> 00:44:48.557
That was inappropriate.
Go on.


00:44:49.059 --> 00:44:51.160
It gets weirder.


00:44:51.162 --> 00:44:54.396
Mom fled the cult and was on
the run with nowhere to go,


00:44:54.398 --> 00:44:57.278
when she gets saved by these
people from another dimension.


00:45:00.671 --> 00:45:02.838
<i>The people of Azarath.</i>


00:45:02.840 --> 00:45:05.941
<i>A realm of beauty,
peace and tranquility</i>


00:45:07.511 --> 00:45:10.779
<i>where, needless to say,
I did not fit in.</i>


00:45:10.781 --> 00:45:13.215
<i>And I must have inherited
my mom's terrible judgment</i>


00:45:13.217 --> 00:45:15.984
<i>because I thought if I found out
more about the monster who made me,</i>


00:45:15.986 --> 00:45:17.953
<i>I'd be able to
make sense of myself.</i>


00:45:51.689 --> 00:45:52.955
Raven...


00:46:10.474 --> 00:46:13.508
Poor Mother, poor Azarath.


00:46:13.510 --> 00:46:15.544
I became its Trojan horse.


00:46:17.081 --> 00:46:19.615
He took me to his
hellish universe.


00:46:19.617 --> 00:46:22.351
I could hardly bear
the horrors I saw there.


00:46:22.353 --> 00:46:24.052
Why did Trigon want you?


00:46:24.054 --> 00:46:27.122
He wanted Earth.
He's a conqueror of worlds.


00:46:27.124 --> 00:46:30.292
But he needs a powerful conduit
to open Earth to his control.


00:46:30.294 --> 00:46:32.227
And you're half human.


00:46:32.229 --> 00:46:33.629
His way in.


00:46:33.631 --> 00:46:36.231
But my magic was stronger
than he realized.


00:46:36.233 --> 00:46:40.269
<i>Before he could use me, I was able
to trap him inside a crystal.</i>


00:46:40.271 --> 00:46:41.770
<i>It should've held him.</i>


00:46:41.772 --> 00:46:43.472
<i>Perhaps if I had stayed there,</i>


00:46:43.474 --> 00:46:44.740
<i>it would have.</i>


00:46:46.210 --> 00:46:48.010
But I wanted a home.


00:46:48.012 --> 00:46:50.178
Why didn't you go back
to Azarath?


00:46:51.448 --> 00:46:52.781
This is Azarath.


00:47:10.501 --> 00:47:12.334
Don't worry, I'm not staying.


00:47:12.336 --> 00:47:15.137
I've got to keep moving
to keep Trigon off my path.


00:47:15.139 --> 00:47:16.538
Where will you go?


00:47:16.540 --> 00:47:18.106
It's better you not know.


00:47:18.108 --> 00:47:20.842
He's going to try to use you
but don't worry,


00:47:20.844 --> 00:47:23.412
I put a protective spell
on you, just in case.


00:47:23.414 --> 00:47:25.947
And I thought I had
a bad burrito.


00:47:25.949 --> 00:47:27.416
Dude.


00:47:27.418 --> 00:47:30.185
Guess I should've gotten
your permission or whatever.


00:47:30.187 --> 00:47:32.187
But I couldn't stand for him
to corrupt you.


00:47:32.189 --> 00:47:34.623
You're the only friends
I've ever really had.


00:47:35.326 --> 00:47:36.625
I'll...


00:47:37.161 --> 00:47:38.226
Miss you.


00:47:43.000 --> 00:47:44.666
Wait!


00:47:44.668 --> 00:47:47.402
Leave now and you'll
always be running.


00:47:47.404 --> 00:47:49.204
You have no idea
what he's like, Damian.


00:47:49.206 --> 00:47:51.173
You've never met
a monster like Trigon.


00:47:51.175 --> 00:47:52.708
You beat him once.


00:47:53.444 --> 00:47:54.943
I was lucky.


00:47:54.945 --> 00:47:57.279
Now you'll be four times
as lucky.


00:47:57.281 --> 00:47:59.581
If we can't save one of our own,


00:47:59.583 --> 00:48:00.849
who can we save?


00:48:00.851 --> 00:48:03.485
I thought you hated us.


00:48:03.487 --> 00:48:05.754
I'm not wishing you
dead anymore.


00:48:05.756 --> 00:48:08.490
Robin's right,
we are your best hope.


00:48:19.303 --> 00:48:20.802
Down, boy.


00:48:20.804 --> 00:48:22.504
We heard about the attack.


00:48:22.506 --> 00:48:24.306
Was she at the center?


00:48:24.308 --> 00:48:27.542
Her father is an inter-dimensional demon.
He was after her.


00:48:27.544 --> 00:48:29.578
She's coming with us.


00:48:29.580 --> 00:48:31.646
No, we can handle this.


00:48:31.648 --> 00:48:34.116
If she's part of this,
we need to know.


00:48:34.118 --> 00:48:35.183
We can protect her.


00:48:39.523 --> 00:48:44.659
I'm sorry, Raven. We've had two magic
attacks and Superman is still missing.


00:48:44.661 --> 00:48:46.928
- No.
- What's the matter?


00:48:46.930 --> 00:48:49.164
He knows they're here,
he wants them here.


00:48:49.166 --> 00:48:50.499
Who?


00:48:50.501 --> 00:48:52.167
If they stay,
everything will be lost.


00:48:52.169 --> 00:48:55.637
This is our job, Father,
you have to leave.


00:48:55.639 --> 00:48:57.406
Father?


00:48:57.408 --> 00:48:59.074
She's coming with us.


00:48:59.076 --> 00:49:00.308
She stays here.


00:49:05.149 --> 00:49:07.816
Maybe we should all
take a breath.


00:49:07.818 --> 00:49:09.818
Too late, they're here.


00:49:14.291 --> 00:49:15.390
Great Hera!


00:49:16.460 --> 00:49:17.559
Argh!


00:49:17.561 --> 00:49:20.128
Argh! We're being compromised.


00:49:21.365 --> 00:49:23.331
- Father!
- Get back.


00:49:27.805 --> 00:49:30.672
- What the hell?
- It's a nerve toxin.


00:49:30.674 --> 00:49:32.140
For Bane.


00:49:36.213 --> 00:49:37.712
Dude...


00:49:44.755 --> 00:49:48.423
The Kryptonian has
unearthed the infernal shrine, Raven.


00:49:48.425 --> 00:49:49.724
The who did the what?


00:49:49.726 --> 00:49:51.626
An ancient shrine
built by Satanists.


00:49:51.628 --> 00:49:53.261
It has magical properties.


00:49:53.263 --> 00:49:56.565
You are the shrine's
final piece.


00:49:56.567 --> 00:49:58.333
She stays here.


00:49:58.335 --> 00:50:01.002
You dare challenge us?


00:50:45.582 --> 00:50:46.848
Whoa!


00:51:01.398 --> 00:51:02.797
Argh!


00:51:13.410 --> 00:51:15.110
Beetle...


00:51:25.188 --> 00:51:26.254
Ugh!


00:51:32.863 --> 00:51:35.297
I will break her, Raven.


00:51:36.667 --> 00:51:39.935
I stop my hand for an instant
and this one dies, too.


00:51:40.404 --> 00:51:42.237
Wait!


00:51:42.239 --> 00:51:45.407
I'll go. As the daughter of
your Lord Trigon,


00:51:45.409 --> 00:51:48.343
I order you to release
these feeble humans.


00:52:05.395 --> 00:52:06.395
Goodbye.


00:52:18.842 --> 00:52:20.442
Get him inside.


00:52:42.899 --> 00:52:45.300
Your father awaits.


00:52:45.302 --> 00:52:46.468
Don't touch me.


00:53:06.356 --> 00:53:09.557
<i>There had better be
no trickery this time, girl,</i>


00:53:09.559 --> 00:53:13.028
<i>if you want any mercy
shown your friends.</i>


00:53:13.563 --> 00:53:14.963
No tricks.


00:53:14.965 --> 00:53:17.799
Look, I'm begging you,
leave this world alone.


00:53:17.801 --> 00:53:19.768
<i>And thwart destiny?</i>


00:53:19.770 --> 00:53:22.637
<i>We were meant to be together.</i>


00:53:22.639 --> 00:53:24.005
<i>Always.</i>


00:53:24.574 --> 00:53:26.341
<i>And we shall.</i>


00:54:01.478 --> 00:54:03.078
Think he's back online.


00:54:03.914 --> 00:54:05.680
Holy crap!


00:54:05.682 --> 00:54:09.050
- Did that sound demonic to anyone else?
- A little.


00:54:10.554 --> 00:54:12.220
The things it made me see.


00:54:13.056 --> 00:54:15.990
Cyborg, how do we save Raven?


00:54:16.693 --> 00:54:17.992
I...


00:54:17.994 --> 00:54:19.961
I don't think you can.


00:54:24.134 --> 00:54:26.668
Oh, no. How bad is he?


00:54:28.205 --> 00:54:30.205
He's been out for 24 hours.


00:54:30.207 --> 00:54:31.773
He sacrificed himself,


00:54:31.775 --> 00:54:35.710
risked death to give us
a fighting chance at life.


00:54:35.712 --> 00:54:37.946
Which is more than I can say
for the rest of the League.


00:54:37.948 --> 00:54:40.815
Damian, this isn't
the time to squabble.


00:54:40.817 --> 00:54:42.016
We have to get Raven back.


00:54:42.018 --> 00:54:44.719
We don't even know where she is.


00:54:44.721 --> 00:54:48.823
She's in the Middle East, 60
miles north of Kahndaq City.


00:54:48.825 --> 00:54:51.159
- How do you...
- I put a tracer on her.


00:54:51.161 --> 00:54:53.962
- When? -About 30
seconds after we met.


00:54:53.964 --> 00:54:56.064
Same time I put one
on each of you.


00:54:57.501 --> 00:54:59.167
What?


00:54:59.169 --> 00:55:03.004
Cyborg, you have the ability to
manifest boom tubes, do you not?


00:55:03.006 --> 00:55:04.672
Yeah, I can boom us there.


00:55:04.674 --> 00:55:07.275
But you guys barely held your own
against Flash and Wonder Woman,


00:55:07.277 --> 00:55:09.878
and that's without Superman
being on deck.


00:55:09.880 --> 00:55:11.579
He shouldn't
be a problem.


00:55:11.581 --> 00:55:14.983
Yeah, right, like you got
a way to take out Superman.


00:55:20.791 --> 00:55:22.423
Oh, my God, I think he does.


00:55:39.242 --> 00:55:40.675
You heard the plan.


00:55:41.545 --> 00:55:43.111
Titans, go!


00:56:28.892 --> 00:56:30.525
You mind removing that?


00:56:40.637 --> 00:56:41.637
What?


00:56:44.708 --> 00:56:45.807
Damian.


00:56:46.610 --> 00:56:47.675
Starfire.


00:56:48.879 --> 00:56:50.245
You okayed this?


00:56:52.315 --> 00:56:53.381
Yes.


00:56:54.451 --> 00:56:55.516
Good call.


00:56:58.622 --> 00:57:00.722
It's okay, it's healing.


00:57:15.071 --> 00:57:18.640
I've got Flash, the rest of
you get Raven off that thing.


00:57:36.760 --> 00:57:38.126
Aah!


00:57:38.995 --> 00:57:40.261
Argh!


00:57:46.503 --> 00:57:48.836
Barry, if you can hear me
in there,


00:57:49.773 --> 00:57:50.838
sorry.


00:57:59.616 --> 00:58:01.582
Ow.


00:58:01.584 --> 00:58:04.018
How long will it take you
to heal?


00:58:04.020 --> 00:58:06.287
Ah, oh, my God, an hour?


00:58:06.289 --> 00:58:08.323
Also, seriously?


00:58:08.325 --> 00:58:09.857
You've got 10 minutes.


00:58:32.682 --> 00:58:36.351
Your power is no match for
that of Trigon, Kryptonian.


00:58:36.353 --> 00:58:38.386
She doesn't belong
to you, devil.


00:58:51.568 --> 00:58:54.235
Let me go, you alien filth.


00:58:59.209 --> 00:59:01.009
You sicken me.


00:59:01.011 --> 00:59:03.277
I never cared.


00:59:03.279 --> 00:59:05.113
I never loved you.


00:59:05.115 --> 00:59:06.614
Who are you?


00:59:06.616 --> 00:59:09.817
I am corruption incarnate,


00:59:09.819 --> 00:59:12.987
you piece of...


00:59:12.989 --> 00:59:15.390
The lasso commands you answer.


00:59:16.126 --> 00:59:17.191
Argh!


00:59:17.193 --> 00:59:19.761
I... I...


00:59:19.763 --> 00:59:20.828
Argh!


00:59:23.900 --> 00:59:26.534
I am Diana of Themyscira.


00:59:26.936 --> 00:59:28.302
Argh!


00:59:34.244 --> 00:59:35.943
It's okay.


00:59:35.945 --> 00:59:37.378
I've got you now.


00:59:38.982 --> 00:59:40.248
Mmm...


00:59:40.950 --> 00:59:42.683
Just like in the movies.


01:00:11.581 --> 01:00:15.249
You can get off my back now,
Boy Bony-ass.


01:00:21.091 --> 01:00:22.890
You all right?


01:00:24.194 --> 01:00:25.660
Nothing is right.


01:00:28.064 --> 01:00:29.764
Run!


01:00:29.766 --> 01:00:31.332
Everyone, run!


01:01:02.966 --> 01:01:04.866
Well, this sucks.


01:01:09.839 --> 01:01:11.005
Great Hera.


01:01:25.522 --> 01:01:27.321
He'll bring hell on Earth.


01:01:27.323 --> 01:01:29.257
How do we stop him?


01:01:29.259 --> 01:01:32.693
- There's only one way. -You're going
to put him back in the crystal.


01:01:32.695 --> 01:01:34.775
In the unlikely event
that I can make it there.


01:01:39.369 --> 01:01:40.468
He's heading for the city.


01:01:40.470 --> 01:01:41.903
<i>Superman,</i>


01:01:41.905 --> 01:01:43.070
Raven has a plan.


01:01:44.073 --> 01:01:45.473
The Titans need my help.


01:01:47.877 --> 01:01:49.043
I'm going to hell.


01:01:54.017 --> 01:01:58.819
Oh, I don't feel so good.


01:01:58.821 --> 01:02:00.788
The crystal can only
be touched by me.


01:02:00.790 --> 01:02:02.823
He may have escaped it,
but he can't destroy it.


01:02:02.825 --> 01:02:05.092
I just hope he left a trail
of breadcrumbs.


01:02:19.142 --> 01:02:20.808
Home, sweet home.


01:02:21.811 --> 01:02:24.145
Can't you just
transport us inside?


01:02:24.147 --> 01:02:25.813
No, it's shielded.


01:02:41.864 --> 01:02:44.599
Maybe this will slow you down.


01:02:50.173 --> 01:02:51.239
Ugh...


01:03:01.417 --> 01:03:02.883
Garfield!


01:03:04.187 --> 01:03:06.520
Dude, what the hell?


01:03:57.407 --> 01:03:59.407
Gar, you still with us?


01:04:27.203 --> 01:04:29.136
Little help!


01:04:39.282 --> 01:04:42.049
- If we cannot stop this creature...
- I know.


01:05:07.143 --> 01:05:08.242
Argh!


01:05:15.718 --> 01:05:19.253
Welcome home,
sister.


01:05:24.694 --> 01:05:26.360
It's the freak show again.


01:06:08.771 --> 01:06:10.638
Get inside!


01:07:05.394 --> 01:07:06.694
Dude!


01:07:40.496 --> 01:07:42.229
Grandfather?


01:07:42.231 --> 01:07:44.832
Damian, my blood.


01:07:46.969 --> 01:07:50.137
It's a trick. I saw you die.


01:07:50.139 --> 01:07:53.474
No trick. It's me.
I assure you.


01:07:54.110 --> 01:07:55.876
I exist.


01:07:55.878 --> 01:07:58.145
Lord Trigon is my sustenance.


01:08:01.017 --> 01:08:03.517
- He's a devil.
- No.


01:08:03.519 --> 01:08:05.886
He's a god of necessity.


01:08:05.888 --> 01:08:07.888
How do you think I attained
my power?


01:08:07.890 --> 01:08:10.357
Where do you think
the Lazarus Pits came from?


01:08:10.993 --> 01:08:13.227
It's all his doing,


01:08:13.229 --> 01:08:17.097
and he can make things
whole again for a price.


01:08:17.099 --> 01:08:19.633
He can give us the world
we wanted.


01:08:19.635 --> 01:08:23.037
You and I. A perfect world.


01:08:23.039 --> 01:08:26.340
She's the only one
who stands in the way.


01:08:26.342 --> 01:08:28.008
Prove your love, Grandson.


01:08:28.010 --> 01:08:30.311
Take care of this for me.


01:08:30.313 --> 01:08:33.814
Before my pact
with Trigon expires.


01:08:34.884 --> 01:08:38.752
I... I would do anything
to bring you back,


01:08:38.754 --> 01:08:41.255
but, Grandfather, I don't...


01:08:41.257 --> 01:08:42.423
You hesitate.


01:08:43.292 --> 01:08:44.959
Why?


01:08:44.961 --> 01:08:49.096
Are you afraid to do the one act
that will restore me to life?


01:08:49.098 --> 01:08:50.998
I'm not afraid of anything.


01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:53.133
You dare disobey me?


01:08:53.135 --> 01:08:55.035
Have you forgotten
your heritage?


01:08:55.037 --> 01:08:57.104
You are an al Ghul.


01:08:57.673 --> 01:09:00.174
No, I'm a Titan.


01:09:07.650 --> 01:09:10.184
<i>Stupid girl.</i>


01:09:10.186 --> 01:09:14.989
<i>You think your allies can
stop me now that I'm here?</i>


01:09:14.991 --> 01:09:21.395
<i>The Justice League, defenders of
this realm, less than insects to me.</i>


01:09:21.397 --> 01:09:25.766
<i>I will strip bare the flesh
from their bones.</i>


01:09:25.768 --> 01:09:31.038
<i>And your pathetic friends, I
will make them suffer endlessly,</i>


01:09:31.040 --> 01:09:34.842
<i>and you will have to watch.</i>


01:09:34.844 --> 01:09:39.380
<i>Soon, your souls will belong
to Trigon,</i>


01:09:39.382 --> 01:09:43.050
<i>as will your world.</i>


01:10:00.069 --> 01:10:02.403
Your friends have made you soft.


01:10:02.972 --> 01:10:05.072
Ungrateful child.


01:10:05.074 --> 01:10:08.842
You could have been immortal,
like me.


01:10:09.545 --> 01:10:12.112
<i>Give up.</i>


01:10:12.114 --> 01:10:14.882
<i>You're too weak
to stop me, Raven.</i>


01:10:14.884 --> 01:10:16.450
<i>You always have been.</i>


01:10:17.553 --> 01:10:19.219
<i>Just like your mother.</i>


01:10:19.221 --> 01:10:22.356
<i>No, my only weakness
was loving you,</i>


01:10:23.092 --> 01:10:25.392
<i>hoping I'd be loved in return.</i>


01:10:25.394 --> 01:10:27.961
<i>But all you were capable
of giving is pain,</i>


01:10:28.597 --> 01:10:29.897
<i>so I ran away</i>


01:10:30.666 --> 01:10:32.032
<i>and found friends,</i>


01:10:33.135 --> 01:10:34.975
<i>friends I would give
my life for,</i>


01:10:35.905 --> 01:10:37.438
<i>friends who give me love</i>


01:10:38.574 --> 01:10:40.107
<i>and the strength to do this.</i>


01:11:13.576 --> 01:11:15.476
Damian, save me!


01:11:34.296 --> 01:11:36.263
Grant me the strength
of mighty Azarath


01:11:36.265 --> 01:11:40.334
to contain the demon Trigon within
this sacred shard, now and forever.


01:11:59.722 --> 01:12:01.054
Huh?


01:13:02.084 --> 01:13:03.417
Raven!


01:13:05.754 --> 01:13:07.521
Is it over?


01:13:07.523 --> 01:13:09.189
It'll never be over.


01:13:09.191 --> 01:13:12.292
Trigon will spend every single
minute trying to get out of here,


01:13:12.294 --> 01:13:16.029
so he needs to be watched
every single minute.


01:13:19.101 --> 01:13:20.567
Dude, thanks for helping out.


01:13:20.569 --> 01:13:22.636
It was nice to have
a big gun around.


01:13:22.638 --> 01:13:26.440
Yeah, you ought to dump those
stuck-up jerks and sign up with us.


01:13:26.442 --> 01:13:28.609
It was nice not to be
the kid for once,


01:13:28.611 --> 01:13:30.777
but when you've been
in the majors...


01:13:30.779 --> 01:13:32.079
You know what I'm saying.


01:13:40.923 --> 01:13:42.222
Time to go home.


01:13:46.896 --> 01:13:48.195
I'll take you back.


01:13:56.472 --> 01:13:57.604
Unfortunately,


01:13:59.775 --> 01:14:01.141
this is my home.


01:14:03.946 --> 01:14:05.245
I have to watch him.


01:14:07.816 --> 01:14:09.216
It's not your home.


01:14:09.919 --> 01:14:11.718
Home is the place where...


01:14:11.720 --> 01:14:16.456
When you have to go there,
they have to take you in.


01:14:16.458 --> 01:14:20.761
Robert Frost. You are full
of surprises, Damian.


01:14:21.664 --> 01:14:23.063
You're coming with us.


01:14:36.912 --> 01:14:38.879
<i>I've
sifted through all the data</i>


01:14:38.881 --> 01:14:41.014
<i>and found no signs of the
corruptors for the 10 days</i>


01:14:41.016 --> 01:14:43.617
<i>since our encounter with Trigon.</i>


01:14:43.619 --> 01:14:46.019
<i>In other words,
great work, Titans.</i>


01:14:46.021 --> 01:14:50.324
<i>Your determination
and teamwork saved the world,</i>


01:14:50.326 --> 01:14:53.794
<i>and us. You should be
very proud of them, Kori.</i>


01:14:57.800 --> 01:14:59.132
<i>As are we.</i>


01:15:02.738 --> 01:15:04.271
Hey, guys, it's pizza night.


01:15:04.273 --> 01:15:06.406
Boom tube delivery.
Less than 30...


01:15:08.610 --> 01:15:09.743
Minutes.


01:15:11.113 --> 01:15:12.679
<i>Carry on, Titans.</i>


01:15:15.050 --> 01:15:16.650
Okay, that was awkward.


01:15:17.653 --> 01:15:19.453
Enough talk. Let's eat.


01:15:24.159 --> 01:15:26.426
Hey, isn't that...


01:15:26.428 --> 01:15:28.268
He always said
we should be together.


01:15:29.298 --> 01:15:31.164
That's gotta be torture for him.


01:15:32.434 --> 01:15:35.168
Well, you can take the girl
out of hell...


01:15:35.170 --> 01:15:37.170
<i>Raven, release me.</i>


01:15:37.172 --> 01:15:41.408
<i>You're too weak to keep me
in here, you filthy witch!</i>


01:15:41.410 --> 01:15:44.911
<i>I'll get out!
I'll kill everyone you love.</i>


01:15:44.913 --> 01:15:46.513
<i>Raven!</i>

